<doc id="7756" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=7756" title="Michelle Branch">
Michelle Branch

Michelle Jacquet DeSevren Branch Landau (lair &lt;a href="2%20Juli"&gt;2 Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1983"&gt;1983&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Phoenix%2C%20Arizona"&gt;Phoenix&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Arizona"&gt;Arizona&lt;/a&gt;) iku siji &lt;a href="penyanyi"&gt;penyanyi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="panulis%20lagu"&gt;panulis lagu&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="gitar"&gt;gitar&lt;/a&gt;is asal &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika lair dhèwèké prématur pitung minggu luwih dhisik. Jenengé ngarep dijupuk saka siji lagu &lt;a href="The%20Beatles"&gt;The Beatles&lt;/a&gt; sing ajudhul &lt;a href="Michelle%20%28The%20Beatles%29"&gt;Michelle&lt;/a&gt;. Penyanyi iki &lt;a href="blasteran"&gt;blasteran&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Irlandia"&gt;Irlandia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Walanda"&gt;Walanda&lt;/a&gt; iki nduwé sadulur loro.
